WEBVTT

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.610
How's it going? Have you had any good ideas?

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.030
Oh, man, this is <i>hard</i>!

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.990
I can't think of <i>anything</i>!

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.820
Calm down and think properly.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.290
Use last time's "poppy soda on a sunny day" as a jumping point.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.280
<i>Embrace it tightly!</i>

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.010
<i>Pri!</i>

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.810
SoLaMi SMILE will create a new Making Drama,

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:32.920
and aim for still greater heights!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.470
We'll keep evolving until the day the goddess Jewlie acknowledges us as Divine Idols!

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.850
Y–Yeah!

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:39.890
Capisce!

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.500
We can't give in!

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:43.340
Right, Jululu?

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:51.330
Hey, Jululu! You're standing by supporting yourself!

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:52.690
Amazing!

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:55.620
She's never done that before! Quick, get the camera!

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.200
C–Capisce!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.570
Amazing!

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:00.000
Way to go, Jululu!

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.330
But it's still impressive.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:12.420
Prez?

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:14.530
The answer to my calculations has revealed itself.

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.880
Jululu is developing steadily.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:21.160
We have to encourage her growth to make her become the goddess Jewlie again!

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.680
Become Jewlie?

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.260
And for that, she must walk!

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.810
You're going to practice walking, Jululu!

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:31.350
Shining!

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:33.260
Capisce!

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.080
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:37.230
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:41.310
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.660
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.030
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:23.230
Autumn, the season of art-Da Vinci!

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:25.170
So Munch creative impulse!

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:28.020
I'm Deskel-perate to share the art within me!

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:34.320
This rocks! This rock paints! Dessin and Renaissance in the sun's rays-Da Vinci!

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:38.670
The sky's so wide and the clouds look like jellyfish.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:39.820
So fluffy...

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.000
Okay, Jululu!

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.930
"I can walk"! "I can walk"!

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:47.320
Come over here!

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.260
"I can walk"!

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:50.330
Come this way!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.730
"I can walk"!

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:57.090
Way to go, Jululu!

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.890
Ayya go!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.970
She's so cute!

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.680
Prez, can you take a photo of us?

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.490
Really? Honestly.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.600
Here we go!

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:09.660
Capisce!

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.880
Ah-ee!

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.740
I want a photo too!

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:19.400
Now there are <i>two</i> goddesses... Just kidding!

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:23.540
Prez!

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.870
Do you want a photo with her too?

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.410
We're here to practice walking, you know!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:33.300
But since you're all taking photos with her, I may as well...

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.890
Say "Capisce"!

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.260
Capisce!

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:45.150
We took a whole bunch of cute photos!

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:46.520
Can you send them to me later?

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:48.440
Yes, send us the images later.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:51.850
Now. That's enough frivolity.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.230
It's time for walking practice.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:55.460
Hey, Jululu...

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.650
It's tickling time!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:59.200
Tickle-tickle!

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:04.570
Tickle-tickle!

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:06.890
Sophie's so cute!

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.010
Ti... ckle...

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.400
Tickle-tickle!

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.080
Will you two calm down?
Tickle-tickle!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.750
Will you two calm down?

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.420
Tickle-tickle!

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.380
Pushu...

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.710
That was fun.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.670
Wait, I mean...

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.640
Jululu, time for walking practice.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:28.570
Or-ee?

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:31.130
By the time <i>I</i> was your age,

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.600
I was walking and running errands by myself.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.770
Lawyer Shop

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:34.990
I was walking and running errands by myself.

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:36.310
That's so amazing!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:39.240
Well, that's only to be expected.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:43.070
I was standing and walking right away after I was born.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:47.310
That's our Prez! I'll have to tell Dorothy and the others later!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.420
It's fine. Don't bother.

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.770
But why?

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:53.790
They'll think it's amazing as well!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.790
It's. Fine. Don't. Bother.

00:05:58.410 --> 00:05:59.900
C–Capisce...

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:01.160
Hm?

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.150
What's wrong, Manaka-san?

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.120
I kind of felt like someone was watching us.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.890
Do you think it might be Amamiya-san?

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.170
Just let it be.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:15.470
Really? Cause usually you'd be all...

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.420
Article 301 of the Mirei Regulations:

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:23.120
Amamiya-kun must not stalk me!

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:25.190
One infringement ticket!

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:25.970
... like that.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.150
Not today.

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:29.460
Ca...

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:30.190
pisce?

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:31.700
Jululu?

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.170
Where did she go?

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.800
Jululu? Where are you?

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:35.660
She's over there!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.040
Jululu!

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.650
Jululu!

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:47.600
No, Jululu, we're not playing!

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:50.000
Don't run off by yourself; it's dangerous!

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.710
Hold on!

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.470
Autumn, the season of sports!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.560
Hip, hip, hoor-Eiko!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:59.020
Love-chan sure is late...

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.440
Wait up!

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:02.480
Hm?

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.670
Sitting, watching the leaves change...

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.650
Nishikigoi...

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.050
Coach...

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:11.660
Love-fifteen...

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.680
<i>Love!</i>

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:20.220
Autumn, the season of love.

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:21.290
Come back!

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:25.280
The PriParis Meganii's child?

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.220
Butterfly...

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:38.780
If I can power-up Junon – make her a super superior cool butterfly – and form a new team...

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:41.000
What kind of butterfly would be best?

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:44.980
In order to beat Onee-chan...

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.480
Love-thirty!

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:48.650
Jululu?

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.990
Today, we picnic – or, rather, devinic.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.210
It's an angelic!

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:59.010
Autumn, the season of angels flying high in Heaven.

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:00.620
Autumn, the season of food!

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.840
Wait!

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:06.590
Hey!

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:09.300
Hey, isn't that Lala?

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.100
Huh?

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.040
Be still!

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.010
Meat buns are tasty!

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.840
Isn't that the PriParis Meganii's kid?

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:20.520
Kazama-kun, pass!

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.980
Nice pass, Takahashi-kun!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.170
You too, Kazama-kun!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.860
Wait!

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.570
That's Manaka-san, and...

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.590
Hey, Ehime Nao's there too!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:41.170
See her, Takahashi-kun?

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:43.770
Hey, yeah. I wonder what Nao-chan's doing?

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.380
You can quit nudging me any time.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.910
How's about we take a look too?

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:47.420
Hold on!

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:51.310
Wait up!

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:53.340
Wait!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.630
Jululu, stop!

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.510
Jululu!

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.160
She's gonna fall in!

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.480
The babe can fly?

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:01.800
Of course she can't!

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.130
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.480
Lovely!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.850
Jululu!

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.070
Parakappa-kun!

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.050
I'm so glad you're okay, Jululu.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:29.480
You're a lifesaver.

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:30.560
Thank you.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:31.720
Nice catch!

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.840
That was a brilliant play, Parakappa-kun!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.590
You're so cool! I love you!

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.020
So anyway...

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:38.460
What's going on here?

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:40.810
That's what <i>I've</i> been wanting to know, too!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:47.460
So you were practicing walking with Jululu-chan.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.580
You're taking care of an acquaintance's kid?

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.980
Looking after a kid for someone...

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:53.900
Very responsible!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.630
Capisce!

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:59.640
I think it's harder for babies to learn to walk than that.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:02.300
If you can walk, I'll give you a meat bun!

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.580
That'd make <i>Mikan</i> come running as though pursued by demons.

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:10.210
If she's already standing, she could just need a push to start walking too!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:11.760
A push...

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.360
Such bliss...

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.000
Say, it couldn't be...

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:28.600
The answer is ascertained.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.020
What Jululu needs in order to walk...

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:33.890
What she needs...

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:35.280
Is love!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.580
LOVE

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.440
Indeed. What's most important is love!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:41.280
Infatuation!

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.620
But we <i>totally</i> love Jul–

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.500
Of course we love Jululu very much.

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:51.080
But sometimes thoughts alone aren't enough.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.500
Thoughts alone...

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.410
aren't enough?

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:56.830
Hear that?

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:57.400
Huh?

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:02.300
All the more for love: you must put it clearly into words!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.150
Huh?

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.410
<i>Put it clearly...</i>

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.550
<i>Into words...</i>

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.980
Confession

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:31.230
Indeed, there are times when you
must put your feelings into words.

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:32.420
Now is such a time!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:35.120
Oh, Jululu! I love you so!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:38.010
Now, leap into my arms, my darling!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.070
I adore you!

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:45.850
Seeking to receive my overflowing love, Jululu learned to walk,

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.100
and found her way into my arms.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:52.010
Jululu?

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:52.660
Wait!

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.110
Hey, Jululu! Come back here!

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.230
I–I should go, too!

00:11:57.450 --> 00:12:01.300
Come on, man, this is it! You've gotta say it in words!

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:03.820
In... words...

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:07.080
Jululu! Where are you?

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:09.630
We shall summon her!

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:11.570
I'll give you a meat bun!

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.500
Jululu!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.580
Love! Jululu!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.170
Hey, there she is!

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.340
Mama!

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:31.230
No, don't <i>come</i> towards me!

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:38.240
Mama!

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.760
And gotcha.

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.120
Safe and sound.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:45.080
Oh, thank goodness!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.400
But who is she?

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:48.600
We can talk about it later. Come on.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.320
What a relief.

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:52.580
Uh, er, Nao-ch– Nao-chan!

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:53.790
Hm?

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:56.990
Um, so Nao-chan – there's something I wanna...

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:01.130
I brought along a folding umbrella.

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.820
C'mon, buddy, you'll get another chance.

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.400
Oh dear...

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.010
I have to get out of the rain.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:15.860
Jululu-chan's getting soaked.

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:21.810
Parakappa-kun...

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:22.920
Para.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:25.340
You're so kind.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.200
Um...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.160
You see...

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:39.570
I'm going to the USP tonight.

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:40.990
I'm studying abroad.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:47.680
But before I go, I want to see my
beloved senpai's face one last time.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.390
Last summer...

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.520
<i>Here you go,</i>

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:05.850
<i>Akita Akiko-san.</i>

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.540
<i>Thank you very much!</i>

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:12.990
My kind, wonderful senpai...

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:15.520
You see, I...

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:21.740
I thought if I followed Minami Mirei,
I'd be sure to run into Amamiya-senpai.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.300
So I looked for him.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:26.240
But I guess I couldn't see him today.

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:30.390
Sorry. I got lost in thought there for a moment.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:47.400
<i>But sometimes thoughts alone aren't enough.</i>

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:48.890
Amamiya-senpai!

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:50.360
I love you!

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:55.810
Thank you.

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:57.080
Hearing that makes me happy.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.520
But I can't answer those feelings.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:05.800
Because there's already someone I adore!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:09.280
Para.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:13.200
Did she just say "love"?

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.660
So she loves Parakappa-kun.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.840
So who is she?

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:22.560
Paprika Academy, Class 1-2's Akita Akiko.

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:25.520
She's the one who was watching me from the shadows.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.220
Huh?

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:29.200
So she was in the grip of powerful admiration.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:29.990
For who?

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.160
That would be me: blessed with brains and beauty!

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:34.180
Such vaunted words for oneself.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:35.920
She's super sure of herself.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.750
I could feel her eyes on my at all times.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:42.290
Pretty sure you're mistaken there-kuma.
Akiko was making doe eyes at Amamiya-kun.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:49.500
She wanted to burn the sight of me into her mind forever before transferring overseas.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:54.470
You have a really high opinion of yourself-usa.
She wanted to burn the sight of <i>Amamiya</i> into her mind.

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:58.180
Capisce you loud and clear!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.320
Your straightforwardness, honesty,

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:03.980
earnestness, kindness:

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:07.160
I love all of it.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:08.820
And I always will.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.270
I love Parakappa-kun too!

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:15.680
Mama!

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:17.500
Um, so, Akiko-san.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.410
Thanks a lot.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:20.700
Not at all.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.750
After all, I made a memory to
cherish when I transfer overseas.

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:26.450
Thank you very much, Miss Minami.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.320
I wish you luck and happiness.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:32.800
She wishes me luck and happiness?

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:38.470
Bye-bye!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.010
I, Takahashi Takashi, love Ehime Nao!

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.730
Thanks, Takahashi-kun.

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:51.610
Let's be just classmates together from here on, too!

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:58.360
Aw man, <i>that</i> didn't work.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:16:59.540
Thought so.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.620
Thou hast a true devilish streak.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.290
Goi! Goi!
Wimblepon

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:09.770
Goi! Goi!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:10.500
Goi-goi?

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:13.740
Um. Hello. It's Love.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:14.970
Tochiotome Love!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.000
Go for it, Love-chan!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.690
Coach, I'm in love with you!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:23.970
Love all!

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.450
Yes, you and I both!

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:31.020
With tennis! We're in love with tennis together!

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:32.600
Love, I'm in love with tennis with you!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:35.550
Yes. Yes, I suppose so.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:37.420
I love...

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:38.930
tennis, too.

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:41.120
Love game.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.420
<i>I love you.</i>

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:50.880
Love... affection...

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.500
Yes! That's it!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:56.920
What is?

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.550
Our new Making Drama.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.840
What?

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.520
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.960
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.670
Starting the Coord Change.

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:21.600
Ribbons, pom-poms and sleeveless.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.780
The lamé fabric and checkered pattern bring a sense of unity!

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:26.100
SoLaMi SMILE...

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:26.700
Lovely...

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:27.400
Pop...

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.270
Cool...

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:29.100
Coord!

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:33.960
All right-kuma! You've completed another Making Drama-kuma!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.050
It'll be bear-illiant!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.520
Mm, how you feeling about this-kuma?

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.860
Cram a sock in it-usa!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:44.740
Just feast your eyes on this-kuma!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:49.480
I could make a <i>heaps</i> better Making Drama if I wanted to.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.360
It'd blow your lame Making Drama outta the water!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.220
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:07.150
Look upon it!

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:08.000
Pri!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:10.720
Let it bloom!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.930
And the winds of romance blow!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:28.140
Dance of the Butterfly!

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:33.500
Super Cyalume Change!

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:40.790
Pri!

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:28.960
That was magnificent, President Mirei!

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:35.850
Until we meet again, Amamiya-senpai.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:42.530
Hey, Onee-chan! That new Making Drama–

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:45.490
you can't have butterflies! Butterflies aren't allowed!

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:47.700
They're Junon's things: get your own!

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:51.140
Huh? Come on, Non, give me a break.

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:53.080
Butterflies belong to everyone.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:56.110
No means no means no!

00:21:57.980 --> 00:22:00.030
That little sister of mine.

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:01.710
You'll wake up Jululu.

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:06.930
Someone's tuckered out from playing all day, huh?

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:10.380
Well, you didn't end up walking,

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:13.130
but don't worry about it.

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:15.860
Goodnight, Jululu.

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:54.620
It's almost the third round of the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.040
Let's capisce our best!

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:59.000
Wow-wow-wow! I want to go see!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:00.170
Oh, but...

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:02.410
Chiri-chan! Long time no see!

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:03.960
Let's go to PriPara together!

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:05.330
Oh, no – no, I can't!

00:24:05.330 --> 00:24:08.690
I <i>can't</i> go to PriPara anymore...

00:24:08.690 --> 00:24:09.940
What? Why?

00:24:09.940 --> 00:24:11.920
Because if I <i>did</i>, I'd... I'd...

00:24:11.920 --> 00:24:14.020
You'd what? What'd happen?

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:16.620
Next time, <i>Chiri-chan's not Cheery!</i>

00:24:16.620 --> 00:24:19.810
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
